                        <button type="button" class="copy-live-proof-btn text-micro font-bold px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-growth-surface border border-growth-border text-growth-emphasis hover:bg-emerald-100 transition-all cursor-pointer shadow-flat" title="Copy with active values substituted">📐 Live Proof</button>
